 ```
 
 Frame numbers count 59.19 Hz video frames from power-on. The MVS BIOS eyecatcher finishes at about frame 600, and Metal Slug's title appears at about frame 1200.
+
+The uPD4990A calendar follows the host's local clock by default, as the real
+chip does. A game may seed its randomness from it, so two runs a second apart
+can take different paths. Pass `--rtc 1997-12-19T12:00:00` when a run has to
+be reproducible (headless tests, `--verify`, screenshots).
 
